.agents/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:24: trailing whitespace.
+- **模块化规范**：使用 ES6 `import`/`export`，禁止 CommonJS `require`
.agents/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:25: trailing whitespace.
