+- **Type Safety**: Detect `any`/`unknown` usage, enforce explicit type declarations
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:28: trailing whitespace.
+- **ArkUI Standards**: Check decorators, state management, layout specifications
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:29: trailing whitespace.
+- **Naming Conventions**: Validate PascalCase, camelCase, UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:30: trailing whitespace.
+- **Performance Optimization**: Identify LazyForEach usage, rendering optimization suggestions
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:31: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:32: trailing whitespace.
+### 2. Smart Auto-Fix
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:33: trailing whitespace.
+- Auto-fix indentation and whitespace issues
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:34: trailing whitespace.
+- Auto-replace px units with vp
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:35: trailing whitespace.
+- Auto-convert CommonJS require to ES6 import
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:36: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:37: trailing whitespace.
+### 3. Flexible Configuration
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:38: trailing whitespace.
+- Support `.arktslintrc.json` configuration file
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:39: trailing whitespace.
