+## Rule Details
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:89: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:90: trailing whitespace.
+### Language Specification (Mandatory)
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:91: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:92: trailing whitespace.
+#### Strict Type Safety
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:93: trailing whitespace.
+- **No `any` type**: All variables and function return values must have explicit types
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:94: trailing whitespace.
+- **No `unknown` type**: Special cases require comments
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:95: trailing whitespace.
+- **Null safety**: Must handle `null` and `undefined`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:96: trailing whitespace.
+- **ESObject usage**: Only use when interacting with JS libraries
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:97: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:98: trailing whitespace.
+#### Syntax Restrictions
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:99: trailing whitespace.
+- **Class field initialization**: Must initialize in declaration or constructor
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:100: trailing whitespace.
+- **Module standards**: Use ES6 `import`/`export`, no CommonJS `require`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:101: trailing whitespace.
+- **Type declarations**: No inline object literals, use named `interface`/`type`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:102: trailing whitespace.
+- **JSON parsing**: Must convert to explicit struct types after `JSON.parse()`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:103: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:104: trailing whitespace.
+### ArkUI Development Standards
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:105: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:106: trailing whitespace.
+#### Component Design
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:107: trailing whitespace.
+- **Decorator checks**: `@Component`, `@Entry` usage standards
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:108: trailing whitespace.
+- **Builder syntax**: No early return or plain statements in `@Builder`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:109: trailing whitespace.
+- **Component splitting**: Single file should not exceed 500 lines
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:110: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:111: trailing whitespace.
+#### State Management
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:112: trailing whitespace.
+- **Decorator selection**: Correct use of `@State`, `@Prop`, `@Link`, `@Provide`/`@Consume`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:113: trailing whitespace.
+- **State updates**: Must update via assignment, no direct object property modification
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:114: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:115: trailing whitespace.
+#### Layout & Styling
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:116: trailing whitespace.
+- **Unit standards**: Use `vp`/`fp`, no hardcoded `px`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:117: trailing whitespace.
+- **Layout performance**: Reduce `Stack`/`Flex` nesting, prefer `RelativeContainer`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:118: trailing whitespace.
+- **List rendering**: Must use `LazyForEach` with unique `keyGenerator`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:119: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:120: trailing whitespace.
+### Performance Optimization
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:121: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:122: trailing whitespace.
+#### Rendering Performance
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:123: trailing whitespace.
+- **LazyForEach**: Long lists must use lazy loading
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:124: trailing whitespace.
+- **Conditional rendering**: Use `visibility` instead of `if/else` for frequent toggles
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:125: trailing whitespace.
+- **Image optimization**: Use `sourceSize` for large images
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:126: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:127: trailing whitespace.
+#### Concurrency & Async
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:128: trailing whitespace.
+- **Main thread relief**: Move time-consuming operations to `TaskPool` or `Worker`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:129: trailing whitespace.
+- **Async standards**: Use Promise or async/await
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:130: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:131: trailing whitespace.
+#### Memory Management
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:132: trailing whitespace.
+- **Resource release**: Unregister listeners and timers in `aboutToDisappear`
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:133: trailing whitespace.
+- **Context leaks**: Don't hold `AbilityContext` or UI component references
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:134: trailing whitespace.
+
.trae/skills/arkts-code-linter/SKILL.md:135: trailing whitespace.
