AGENTS.md:64: trailing whitespace.
+
AGENTS.md:65: trailing whitespace.
+### 4.1 目录结构
AGENTS.md:66: trailing whitespace.
+```text
AGENTS.md:67: trailing whitespace.
+entry/src/main/ets/
AGENTS.md:68: trailing whitespace.
+├── pages/          # 页面入口 (@Entry)
AGENTS.md:69: trailing whitespace.
+├── components/     # 公共 UI 组件
AGENTS.md:70: trailing whitespace.
+├── model/          # 数据模型 (Class/Interface)
AGENTS.md:71: trailing whitespace.
+├── utils/          # 工具类
AGENTS.md:72: trailing whitespace.
+├── service/        # 业务逻辑服务 (API, Database)
